+title: "Long-stay discount"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+# Long-stay discount
+
+A rental of 3 days or more costs 10% less than its full price (days × daily price). `quote` and `book` both return the reduced total. The total stays an integer number of euro cents: the reduced price is rounded to the nearest cent (halves round up). Rentals of 1 or 2 days are unchanged.
